      "content": "it's not even about a \"pause\" anymore. i don't want a break or a vacation. i just want it to stop. forever. like, if i could just go to sleep and just... not have to face tomorrow, or the next month, or anything. it feels like the only way to actually get some peace is to just not be here. does that sound insane?",
