      "content": "i know there are people to call but they just give you the same scripted answers. they tell you it gets better but it doesn't. it just keeps going and going and i'm so drained. feels like im just a machine that's supposed to keep running but the gears are totally broken. sometimes i think the only logical solution to this kind of constant, heavy weight is to just... exit. like, why is that considered wrong when everything else feels so wrong?",
